<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-primary mb-4">{{ page.title | default: 'Special Provisions & Care Policy' }}</h1>
    <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
    <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      This page covers health alerts, international restrictions, anonymity, and safety protocols.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
    
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Allergy Warning</h2>
        <p>Senders must state on the product page under 'Additional Information' if the recipient suffers from pollen, food, or any product-related allergies. We strongly advise against ordering items that could trigger a medical reaction for the recipient.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Anonymous (Incognito) Deliveries</h2>
        <p>Senders can choose to remain anonymous. However, upon receiving a formal written request from the recipient, Floral India reserves the right to disclose the sender's identity on the 7th day following delivery. The sender will be contacted before this disclosure is made.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Legal Notices</h2>
        <p>The sender will be fully informed of any legal notices received by Floral India regarding their specific order.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">International Alcohol Deliveries</h2>
        <p>For international orders containing alcohol, fulfillment will be redirected to our licensed regional associates in that destination country. All patrons must strictly adhere to the legal drinking age of the respective country.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-blue-100">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">Health & Safety Protocols</h2>
        <p class="mb-3 text-blue-800">To maintain hygiene standards, we strictly incorporate:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-blue-900"><strong>Contactless delivery</strong> upon request (the recipient is called upon arrival).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-blue-900"><strong>Mandatory temperature checks</strong> for delivery executives 30 minutes prior to dispatch.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-blue-900"><strong>Strict sanitization mandates</strong> across packaging, fulfillment, and delivery stages.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Special Provisions",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
